{"reviewId": "221256531_867q3j62s", "review": {"abstract": "所以，商品的反弹应该是可以预期的，而商品价格终极低点的出现大约在第一低点的两三年之后，这也符合我们上面的预测值，商品价格的终极低点将出现在2018—2019年。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "预测得太NB了！读到这本书太晚了，听说这本书很早，那时受老巴和老唐的影响，对周期不屑一顾，满脑子念经“买股票就是买公司”……  还用席勒市盈率来进行估值，真有点扯淡。既然是周期股，就没必要长期投资，与周期共舞岂不是更好？ 发现周期、识别周期、利用周期！", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "21626-21706", "createTime": 1768272002, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "221256531_867q3j62s", "userVid": 221256531, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 221256531, "name": "日新", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-H0wIa3C1cUHj2teJ~F91Pa4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "日新", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "茶，书，乐。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "日拱一卒", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 204366970, "name": "dove", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/q0CXT6RDScOPE3v2hibLb7WMYrAZknkzSwmoaPCOtPRibrTClD1aLuibbgj5ibgRcxKvTJrtrnMlVicxgzyoZAqUUTVSS4mFURzUcl75ibb0rlAto/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelI